WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:01.167
Desperate Housewives

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.135
star Felicity

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:04.204
Huffman is finally speaking out

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:04.904
about her role

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:06.239
in that college admissions

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:09.242
scandal known as Operation Varsity Blues.

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:10.410
Huffman, as you may recall,

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.211
pleaded guilty

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:13.780
to paying $15,000

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.082
to falsify her daughter's SAT scores.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.450
It's a crime that sent the Emmy

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.886
winning actress to prison.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:21.254
Stephanie, Steph, CNN,

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:22.889
Stephanie Elam is here with the story.

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:23.523
And Stephanie

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:24.591
Huffman says

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:25.825
she initially thought

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:28.495
her arrest was a joke.

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:30.397
Yeah, she did not think that anything

00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:31.965
this serious would happen to her.

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:34.000
And, you know, she was one of 33

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:34.968
wealthy parents

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.669
who were using that wealth

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.971
and their influence

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:38.772
to work to try

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:39.839
to get their kids to cheat,

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:40.907
to get them into these top

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:42.175
notch colleges.

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:43.543
She says the way it went down

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.411
and this is the first time

00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:45.578
we're hearing from her,

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:46.413
she really did

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.514
not think it was a real deal.

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:47.781
In fact,

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:49.382
take a listen to what she told

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:52.786
our affiliate KABC.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.922
They woke my daughters up at gunpoint.

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.524
Again, nothing new

00:00:57.524 --> 00:01:02.462
to the black and brown community.

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:04.697
Then they put my hands behind my back

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.166
and handcuffed me

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:08.101
and I asked if I could get dressed

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:13.106
and I thought it was a hoax.

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:16.443
She says hindsight being 2020,

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.144
that she really felt like

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:19.779
she was going to be a bad mother

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:22.782
if she did not go through with this plan

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:24.818
as it was all coming to her,

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:25.852
as she was hearing about this

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:26.619
and that she wasn't going

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:27.921
be able to get her daughter into school

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.522
without doing it.

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:30.023
In fact,

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:30.857
listen to a little bit

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:33.026
more of how she explains her

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:37.263
decision process to arrive where she did.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.532
I had to give my daughter a chance

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:42.869
at a future.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.804
And

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:45.872
so it was sort of like

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:48.108
my daughter's future,

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.442
which meant I had to break the law.

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:50.977
I kept thinking, turn around.

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:52.879
Just turn around.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:58.751
And to my undying shame, I didn't.

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.753
Yeah, she talks a lot about her shame.

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:02.722
She also apologized, quote,

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:04.290
to the students and families

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.191
that sacrificed

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.392
and worked really hard to get to

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:08.161
where they are going legitimately.

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:09.362
In December 2019,

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:11.798
she was sentenced to 14 days in prison.

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:13.299
She also got a year of probation,

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:15.768
250 hours of community service

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:18.505
on top of a fine of $30,000 Jake.

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:20.507
Why are you speaking out now?

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:21.908
That's what everyone wanted to know.

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:23.042
It's like, why now?

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.444
Like, why are we talking about this?

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:26.045
Well, it has a lot to do

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:27.347
with that community work

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:28.548
that she started doing.

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.183
She started volunteering

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:31.050
at an organization

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.418
called A New Way of Life.

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:33.253
It's a nonprofit

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:36.122
that helps previously incarcerated women

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:37.157
get back on their feet

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:38.491
with housing, clothing,

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:39.993
job training, all of that.

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:41.528
And so she started working there.

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:43.429
The founder of the organization said

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:44.030
that she was just going

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.565
to put Huffman at a desk,

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:47.000
but instead she said

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.601
no, I really do want to work.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:49.402
So she started

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:50.870
coming up with exercise program.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.872
She started organizing the donations

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:53.273
that were

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:54.007
they were getting,

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:54.340
and it's

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:57.043
now joined the board of directors.

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:58.878
So really putting in the work

00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:01.447
and now trying to use her infamy

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:02.315
in this case

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:02.916
to highlight

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:04.551
the good work of this organization

00:03:04.551 --> 00:03:05.852
in South L.A..

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:06.152
All right,

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.554
Stephanie Elam, thank you so much.

